<title>POLAND: Petrobank Q2 net rises to PLN 2.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Petrobank Q2 net rises to PLN 2.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petrobank SA preliminary results for the second  quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997     Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			4.17   vs   2.36</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  4.17   vs   2.36</p>
<p>    net profit				2.33   vs   1.40</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Petrobank SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	    0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues    25.70   vs  16.58</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	  9.91   vs   8.67</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	    1.50   vs   1.00</p>
<p>    costs of commission		   0.22   vs   0.08</p>
<p>    income tax				1.84   vs   0.96</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		  0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>					     H1 1997     H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     12.69   vs   6.06</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 12.69   vs   6.06</p>
<p>    net profit				7.22   vs   3.59</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	    0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues    49.89   vs  32.01</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	 18.99   vs  16.48</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	    2.65   vs   2.01</p>
<p>    costs of commission		   0.41   vs   0.15</p>
<p>    income tax				5.48   vs   2.47</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		  0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
